WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.712
"Bird, I'm going to the beach!" said Kip.

2
00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:15.713
"Want to come with me?"

3
00:00:15.714 --> 00:00:18.026
"Of course," said Bird.

4
00:00:18.027 --> 00:00:21.700
"I love the beach."

5
00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:30.107
"I can't wait to get there," said Bird.

6
00:00:30.108 --> 00:00:32.678
"I'm going to play in the water."

7
00:00:32.679 --> 00:00:35.663
"I'm not going to play," said Kip.

8
00:00:35.664 --> 00:00:38.003
"I have work to do."

9
00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:41.225
"You have work to do?" asked Bird.

10
00:00:41.226 --> 00:00:47.239
"Yes," said Kip.

11
00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.857
"I'm going to build a boat." "You're

12
00:00:50.858 --> 00:00:54.891
going to build a boat?" asked Bird. "Are

13
00:00:54.892 --> 00:00:57.726
you going sailing?" "No,"

14
00:00:57.727 --> 00:01:03.623
said Kip. " We are going sailing."

15
00:01:03.624 --> 00:01:06.431
"On the ocean?" asked Bird.

16
00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:11.637
"Yes," said Kip.

17
00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:16.140
"On the ocean. We're going to have an adventure!"

18
00:01:16.141 --> 00:01:26.377
"I'm not so sure about this," said Bird.

19
00:01:26.378 --> 00:01:32.702
"Do you know how to build a boat?" asked Bird.

20
00:01:32.703 --> 00:01:36.646
"I think so," said Kip.

21
00:01:36.647 --> 00:01:41.831
"How hard could it be?"

